ll several times before  we've used it for a lot less do you  remember the full moon party at comtaj  no exactly as we saw with peter having  to take the ged to regain his academic  records that spell warps reality to  justify people being faded from memories  so the fact that strange could just  consider it a standard memory spell and  then have used it more than once in the  past leads us to wonder what other  components of the mcu reality have we  all taken for granted that might have  actually have been the result of past  gaslighting on all of us the prove it  that strange charges that american  chavez might actually be in response to  her telling them that the mcu reality of  earth 19999  is a flawed incomplete reality really  the redheaded step reality like how the  hell do you not have mutants in a  fantastic four in your universe why is  everyone so confused how the defenders  and the ages of shield fit in it's  because this universe is already patched  with duct tape after infinite glitches  in the matrix that we never were aware  of and the only sensible way forward is  to reboot it i mean it's either that  folks or prove it is strange's response  to america telling him that gargantos is  his bastard's son prove it oh wait i did  hook up with nyarlathotep at that full  moon party now another new shot that  looked pretty sick was of the scarlet  witch's seance with the camera orbiting  her as she levitates camera now takes on  the point of view of one of those red  chaos magic orbs that revolved around  her the last time we saw her in this  pose in the one division post-credits  scene now we know this seance is going  to be an important part of the film it  has appeared in every trailer for the  film and was depicted on the cover  artwork of empire magazine i have  speculated that this could be taking  place in the courtyard of camaratosh  based on the floor tile beneath her feet  matching the geometric tile  configuration we've seen elsewhere in  camara taj like in the shot of wintra  and the other sorcerers being attacked  with explosions but this orbital shot  shows us more the surrounding  architecture in the background including  the inner chamber directly behind wanda  lit with a golden glow and at the far  end three windows that open up to a pale  blue and white location i wondered if  these could be a type of rotunda gateway  for camartage like the one wong and  strange left open to siberia that  allowed a blizzard to freeze the  interior of the new york sanctum one of  the rotunda gateways connects to siberia  but blizzard blasted through  because someone forgot to cast a monthly  maintenance spell to keep the seals  tight by the way i still find it  interesting why spider-man no way home  would go to so much effort to construct  an entire frozen sanctum set just for a  throwaway joke and it reminds me a lot  of how sony allowed skrulls to tie into  spider-man far from home as a concession  to their producing partners marvel  studios for a separate project that  feige had in the works and that the  frozen sanctum with the rotunda gateway  left open could actually be a plot point  that will come back in multiverse  madness i might be overthinking it i do  that a lot but that set and its multiple  phases of dethaling throughout the film  just would have been a sizable chunk of  the production budget for just one gag  with zero other plot implications now  sure marvel pours cash into resizing  gags in the ant-man movies but those set  pieces are really core to the appeal of  the ant-man world the reason people go  watch those movies but a frozen sanctum  had nothing to do with the spider-man  movie this is just a mouthful of saying  that doctor strange and wong's unclosed  rotunda gateway could be a symptom of  bigger problems within the sorcerer  network at the very least sorcerer's  supreme wong letting its  responsibilities fall through the cracks  because other crises are demanding his  attention which would explain why he was  rushing back to camertaj in no way home  i've also been pointing out how the  transportation methods for characters  multiverse and madness based on other  trailer footage seems to be broken or at  least disabled at the moment no one in  the footage we've seen so far has used  sling ring portals once instead we've  been seeing other magical ways of  getting around like trick doors star  portals maybe after ned overused sling  ring portals and no way home the  sorcerers have for now shut down the  whole network the windows behind wanda  in her seance could be that new york  sanctum's glitchy rotunda gateway link  frozen on the other side that wanda  could have used to transport herself to  camartage or alternatively this gateway  could be an exit point to another  location like the blue tinted british  museum set of the illuminati citadel  which we know wanda will also attack in  another sequence of the film but my  favorite new detail about wanda is in  her new scarlet witch costume which ever  since we realized this is an upgrade  from the wandavision version of the look  we keep finding more details hidden in  the design here like the mind stone  shaped opening on the collar to show her  ongoing grief over losing vision but the  empire magazine photos gave us a clearer  look at the text strain throughout these  wardrobe pieces her tiara her shoulders  her chest pieces are all covered in  these scratches and if you look closely  they're all radiating outward from her  heart just a fascinating way of showing  how all of wanda's actions in this film  her breaking of reality or breaking into  the multiverse all stem from a broken  heart you can follow me on instagram and  twitter ida boss follow me rockstar  subscribe to rockstar some more analysis  of everything you love thanks for  watching bye  [Music]  you

